---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="After Dark Mode – Late Night Chat After 11PM | Airwalk Blog" description="Airwalk's After Dark mode activates at 11PM for deeper, more intimate late-night conversations with strangers. Night owls welcome.">
  <header class="fixed top-0 w-full z-50 bg-gray-900/80 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-gray-800">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-4 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="/" class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Airwalk</a>
      <a href="/chat" class="bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium transition">Start Chatting</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-12 space-y-6 mt-20">
    <article class="space-y-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white">After Dark Mode: Where Late-Night Conversations Come Alive</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Published on June 3, 2026</p>

      <p class="text-gray-300">The best conversations happen after midnight. There's something about the quiet hours that makes people more open, more honest, more real. Airwalk's After Dark mode is built specifically for those late-night moments when you want deeper connections.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">What Is After Dark Mode?</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">After Dark activates automatically at 11PM in your local time zone. The interface shifts to a deeper, warmer aesthetic. Conversation prompts become more thoughtful. The matching algorithm prioritizes people looking for meaningful exchanges over casual banter. It's the same Airwalk you love, tuned for the night.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Why Late-Night Chats Hit Different</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Science backs this up — people are more emotionally open at night. Inhibitions drop. Vulnerability increases. The daytime persona fades and you get the real person underneath. After Dark mode leans into this natural human tendency, creating a space where authentic conversations flourish.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">A Vibe Shift You Can Feel</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Everything changes in After Dark. The color palette deepens. Ambient cues create a cozy atmosphere. Even the conversation starters are different — think "What keeps you up at night?" instead of "What do you do for work?" It's intentionally designed for people who want more than surface-level chat.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Safe Space, Always</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Late-night doesn't mean anything goes. Airwalk's community guidelines and moderation remain active 24/7. After Dark is about emotional depth, not inappropriate content. It's a safe space for night owls who want genuine human connection when the rest of the world is asleep.</p>

      <p class="text-gray-300">When the sun goes down, the real conversations begin.</p>
    </article>

    <div class="text-center py-8 border-t border-gray-800">
      <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4">Night owl? After Dark is waiting for you.</p>
      <a href="/chat" class="inline-block bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-medium transition">Chat After Dark</a>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="border-t border-gray-800 py-8 text-center text-gray-500 text-sm">
    <p>&copy; 2026 Airwalk. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>
</Layout>
